{
  "url": "https://quranenc.com/en/browse/english_saheeh/111",
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "6217",
      "sura": "111",
      "aya": "1",
      "arabic_text": "تَبَّتۡ يَدَآ أَبِي لَهَبٖ وَتَبَّ",
      "translation": "May the hands of Abū Lahab be ruined, and ruined is he.[2008]",
      "footnotes": "[2008] Abū Lahab (the Prophet's uncle) , who was an enemy of Islām."
    },
    {
      "id": "6218",
      "sura": "111",
      "aya": "2",
      "arabic_text": "مَآ أَغۡنَىٰ عَنۡهُ مَالُهُۥ وَمَا كَسَبَ",
      "translation": "His wealth will not avail him or that which he gained.",
      "footnotes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6219",
      "sura": "111",
      "aya": "3",
      "arabic_text": "سَيَصۡلَىٰ نَارٗا ذَاتَ لَهَبٖ",
      "translation": "He will [enter to] burn in a Fire of [blazing] flame",
      "footnotes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6220",
      "sura": "111",
      "aya": "4",
      "arabic_text": "وَٱمۡرَأَتُهُۥ حَمَّالَةَ ٱلۡحَطَبِ",
      "translation": "And his wife [as well] - the carrier of firewood.[2009]",
      "footnotes": "[2009] She used to put thorns in the Prophet's path and slander him (ﷺ) . The word \"firewood\" was used by the Arabs to allude to slander and backbiting."
    },
    {
      "id": "6221",
      "sura": "111",
      "aya": "5",
      "arabic_text": "فِي جِيدِهَا حَبۡلٞ مِّن مَّسَدِۭ",
      "translation": "Around her neck is a rope of [twisted] fiber.",
      "footnotes": ""
    }
  ],
